# COMMAND

## ReplaceKnowledgeSourceRequest

- input-kind :: COMMAND

### DESCRIPTION

Input command identifying one logical BoK source generation.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| source | BokKnowledgeSource | 1 |

# QUERY

## SearchTermsRequest

- input-kind :: QUERY

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| query | BokTermSearchText | 1 |
| category | BokTermCategory | ? |
| limit | int | ? |

## ExplainTermRequest

- input-kind :: QUERY

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| term | BokTermSearchText | 1 |

## ComponentReferenceSearchRequest

- input-kind :: QUERY

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
