| limit | int | ? |

## ComponentReferenceLookupRequest

- input-kind :: QUERY

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| name | ComponentName | 1 |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| kind | ComponentKind | ? |

# VALUE

## BokKnowledgeSource

### DESCRIPTION

Logical BoK source descriptor consumed later through the CNCF resource DSL.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| sourceId | BokSourceId | 1 |
| datasetId | BokDatasetId | 1 |
| generation | BokSourceGeneration | 1 |
| resource | BokResourceReference | 1 |

## BokEvidence

### DESCRIPTION

Attributable evidence retained with a BoK term or component existence record.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| uri | BokEvidenceUri | 1 |
| sourceId | BokSourceId | 1 |
| sourceVersion | BokSourceVersion | ? |
| observedAt | BokObservedAt | ? |
| freshness | BokFreshness | ? |

## BokTerm

### DESCRIPTION

Curated term owned by the BoK domain.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| termId | BokTermId | 1 |
| title | BokTermTitle | 1 |
| definition | BokTermDefinition | 1 |
| category | BokTermCategory | ? |
| termType | BokTermType | 1 |
| datasetId | BokDatasetId | 1 |
| evidence | BokEvidence | 1 |

## BokTermMatch

### DESCRIPTION

One evidence-bearing terminology match.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| term | BokTerm | 1 |
| matchKind | BokMatchKind | 1 |
| score | double | 1 |
| rationale | BokMatchRationale | 1 |

## ComponentReference

### DESCRIPTION

Stable proof that one CAR or SAR exists. Usage, dependency, operation, and
runtime compatibility detail is intentionally excluded.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| sourceId | ComponentSourceId | ? |
| catalogId | ComponentCatalogId | ? |
| organization | ComponentOrganization | ? |
| name | ComponentName | 1 |
| title | ComponentTitle | 1 |
| kind | ComponentKind | 1 |
| version | ComponentVersion | ? |
| evidence | BokEvidence | 1 |

## ComponentReferenceMatch

### DESCRIPTION

Search evidence associated with one existence-only component reference.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| reference | ComponentReference | 1 |
| matchKind | BokMatchKind | 1 |
| score | double | 1 |
| rationale | BokMatchRationale | 1 |

## ReplaceKnowledgeSourceResponse

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| status | BokQueryStatus | 1 |
| sourceId | BokSourceId | 1 |
| datasetId | BokDatasetId | 1 |
| generation | BokSourceGeneration | 1 |
| termCount | int | 1 |
| componentCount | int | 1 |
| warnings | BokWarning | * |

## SearchTermsResponse

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| status | BokQueryStatus | 1 |
| query | BokTermSearchText | 1 |
| results | BokTermMatch | * |
| warnings | BokWarning | * |

