### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| status | BokQueryStatus | 1 |
| query | BokTermSearchText | 1 |
| result | BokTermMatch | ? |
| warnings | BokWarning | * |

## ComponentReferenceSearchResponse

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| status | BokQueryStatus | 1 |
| query | ComponentSearchText | 1 |
| results | ComponentReferenceMatch | * |
| warnings | BokWarning | * |

## ComponentReferenceLookupResponse

### ATTRIBUTE

| name | type | multiplicity |
|------|------|--------------|
| status | BokQueryStatus | 1 |
| reference | ComponentReference | ? |
| warnings | BokWarning | * |
